# Spring Boot factory registrations for the Account Management service (Feature F-003).
#
# EnvironmentPostProcessor implementations are discovered through this spring.factories key
# (the META-INF/spring/*.imports resource mechanism applies only to auto-configuration and is
# NOT consulted for this SPI). Registering the datasource preflight here ensures it participates
# in environment preparation before any datasource/Flyway/JPA bean is created.
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.aws.carddemo.account.config.DockerDatasourceEnvironmentPostProcessor
